{"id":"lesson-1727","topicId":1727,"title":"2 烛之武退秦师","sourceTitle":"2 烛之武退秦师","blockId":"bixiu-xia","blockTitle":"必修下","forumUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/t/topic/1727","createdAt":"2024-08-22T00:31:46Z","updatedAt":"2024-08-22T00:31:46Z","postCount":1,"excerpt":"烛之武退秦师[1] 《左传》 image968×811 123 KB 春秋列国形势简图（前630 年） 晋侯、秦伯[2]围郑，以其无礼于晋[3]，且贰于楚[4]也。晋军函陵[5]，秦军氾南[6]。 佚之狐[7]言于郑伯[8]曰：“国危矣，若使烛之武见秦君，师必退。” 公从之。辞曰：“臣之壮[9]也，犹[10]不如人；今老矣，无能为也已[11]。” 公曰：“吾不能早用子，今急而求子，是寡人之过也。然郑亡，子亦有不利焉。”许[12]之。 夜缒[13]而出，见秦伯，曰：“秦、晋围郑，郑既[14]知亡矣。若亡郑而有益于君，敢以烦执事[15]。越国以鄙远[16]，君知其难也，焉用亡郑以陪邻[17]？邻之厚，君之薄也[18]。若舍郑以为东道主[19]，行李[20]之往来，共其乏困[21]，君亦无所害。且君尝为晋君赐矣[22]，许君焦、瑕[23]，朝济而夕设版焉[24]，君之所知也。夫晋，何厌之有？既东封郑[25]，又欲肆其西封[26]，若不","textbook":{"bookId":"高中_语文_普通高中教科书_语文必修_下册","bookTitle":"普通高中教科书·语文必修 下册（人教版）","imageBase":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628","tocLabel":"2 烛之武退秦师/《左传》","tocScore":1.0,"startPage":16,"pages":[16,17,18,19,20,21,22,23],"pageImages":[{"page":16,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p16.webp","label":"p16"},{"page":17,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p17.webp","label":"p17"},{"page":18,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p18.webp","label":"p18"},{"page":19,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p19.webp","label":"p19"},{"page":20,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p20.webp","label":"p20"},{"page":21,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p21.webp","label":"p21"},{"page":22,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p22.webp","label":"p22"},{"page":23,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p23.webp","label":"p23"}]},"forumImages":[{"src":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/b/b1e7fe6606bd7369b7cd3c43c0e49c520fc6f0b7.jpeg","alt":"image","width":968,"height":811,"postNumber":1}],"resources":[{"href":"#footnote-11174-1","text":"[1]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/b/b1e7fe6606bd7369b7cd3c43c0e49c520fc6f0b7.jpeg","text":"image968×811 123 KB","kind":"upload",